Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.69,0:01:50.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}This is what they look like in a lab today, at the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.89,0:01:53.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Walter Reed Army Institute of Research.
