Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.93,0:05:28.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Meanwhile, drug companies joined in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.99,0:05:30.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}At first, four of them:
