Dialogue: 3,0:06:38.56,0:06:44.31,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}A U.S. ARMY HOSPITAL IS SET UP IN NORMANDY
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.17,0:08:41.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Some bacteria fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.72,0:08:44.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}They make an enzyme, beta-lactamase, that breaks
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.69,0:08:47.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}down part of the drug before it can work.
