Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.27,0:09:15.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The military tracks the problem too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.73,0:09:19.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}At the Walter Reed Army Institute of Research, one
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.16,0:09:22.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}network watches for antibiotic-resistant bacteria
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.52,0:09:24.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}across the Army, Navy and Air Force.
