Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.09,0:09:59.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It took a team in Oxford, a lab in Peoria, a
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.46,0:10:03.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}cantaloupe, and 21 companies to turn it into a medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.76,0:10:05.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In time for D-Day.
